Output docs/demo.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1100
Set Height 640
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Hide
Type "go build -o bosun ./cmd" Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "./bosun" Enter
Sleep 2s
Show

Sleep 1s
Down@800ms 2
Sleep 800ms
Up@800ms 1
Sleep 1s

Enter
Sleep 3s
Tab
Sleep 500ms
Down@400ms 6
Sleep 1s
Escape
Sleep 1s

Type "S"
Sleep 3s
Escape
Sleep 1s

Type "?"
Sleep 2500ms
Type "?"
Sleep 1s

Type "q"
Sleep 1s
